    <h2>8. Business Operations Across Australian Time Zones</h2>
    <p>
      Managing corporate workflows across Australia requires scheduling systems that account for the 3-hour east-west timezone split and the seasonal DST changes that divide the eastern seaboard.
    </p>

    <!-- Visual Asset 7: Australian Business Hours Infographic -->
    <figure style="margin: 2.5rem 0; text-align: center; border: 1px solid var(--line); padding: 1.5rem; border-radius: 12px; background: var(--panel);">
