  <section id="programming-tech" class="content-section reveal" aria-label="Programming &amp; Technology Guidelines">
    <h2>9. Programming &amp; Technology Guidelines</h2>
    <p>
      In software engineering, handling Australian time zones requires strict compliance with international standards to prevent calendar errors, log mismatches, and data corruption.
    </p>

    <!-- Visual Asset 9: Programming with Australian Time Zones -->
    <figure style="margin: 2.5rem 0; text-align: center; border: 1px solid var(--line); padding: 1.5rem; border-radius: 12px; background: var(--panel);">
      <img 
        src="/assets/programming-australian-time-zones.webp" 
